  "description": {
    "en": "Tecnifibre X-One Biphase is one of the world's benchmark premium multifilament strings. Built with over 1,400 Elastyl and H²C fibres, impregnated with highly elastic PU400 polyurethane and finished with Tecnifibre's exclusive Biphase pre-stretch process, it delivers exceptional comfort, feel, power and outstanding tension maintenance. SPL surface treatment also improves snap-back for additional spin compared with traditional multifilaments.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre X-One Biphase 是全球公认的顶级多芯球线之一。采用超过1400根 Elastyl 与 H²C 纤维，通过 PU400 高弹性聚氨酯整体浸润，并结合 Tecnifibre 独有的 Biphase 双向预拉伸工艺制造，使其拥有极佳的力量输出、舒适性、击球反馈以及优秀的保磅性能。表面的 SPL 涂层还能帮助球线快速回位，提高 Snapback 效果，使旋转表现优于传统多芯线。"
  },

